@startuml IA-Agent-FastAPI-Architecture
title AI Agent FastAPI - Architecture

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Client

package "FastAPI App" {
  [API Routers] as Routers
  [AgentService] as AgentService
  [MemoryService] as MemoryService
  [RagService] as RagService
  [LlmService] as LlmService
  [ToolsService] as ToolsService
  [McpClientService] as McpClientService
}

package "Providers" {
  [OpenAI / Ollama / Anthropic] as LlmProviders
  [InMemory / Redis Memory] as MemoryProviders
  [InMemory / Redis RAG] as RagProviders
}

package "Utilities" {
  [Language Detection] as LanguageDetection
  [Prompt Builder] as PromptBuilder
  [RAG Ingestion] as RagIngestion
}

package "Local MCP Server" {
  [app.mcp_server.server] as LocalMcpServer
}

database "Redis" as Redis
folder "RAG Documents" as RagDocs
cloud "LLM APIs / Ollama" as LlmApis
cloud "Remote MCP Servers" as RemoteMcp
cloud "HTTP Tool Endpoints" as HttpTools

Client --> Routers
Routers --> AgentService : /agent/ask
Routers --> MemoryService : /memory/*
Routers --> RagService : /rag/reindex

AgentService --> LanguageDetection
AgentService --> MemoryService
AgentService --> RagService
AgentService --> PromptBuilder
AgentService --> LlmService
AgentService --> MemoryService : save messages

LlmService --> ToolsService
LlmService --> McpClientService
LlmService --> LlmProviders
LlmProviders --> LlmApis

MemoryService --> MemoryProviders
MemoryProviders --> Redis

RagService --> RagProviders
RagProviders --> RagIngestion
RagIngestion --> RagDocs
RagProviders --> Redis

ToolsService --> HttpTools
McpClientService --> RemoteMcp
McpClientService --> LocalMcpServer

note right of AgentService
Main flow
1. Detect language
2. Load memory
3. Retrieve RAG context
4. Build messages
5. Call LLM
6. Persist conversation
end note

@enduml
